Package: cdfinv
Type: Package
Title: Confidence Interval Estimation via CDF Inversion
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = c("Peter", "E."),family = "Freeman", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "pfreeman@cmu.edu")
Description: Estimation of one- and two-sided confidence intervals 
    via the numerical inversion of the cumulative distribution function
    of a statistic's sampling distribution. For more details, see
    section 9.2.3 of Casella and Berger (2002) <ISBN:0534243126>.
